{"id":"d4a7833057f5a20e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-satisfaction.md","title":"结构赋值下的满足关系","display":"df-satisfaction — 结构赋值下的满足关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-satisfaction","aliases":["20-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — 结构赋值下的满足关系","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 的逻辑背景；本地 Tarski 递归展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — 结构赋值下的满足关系"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 的逻辑背景；本地 Tarski 递归展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\)</span> 采用上游签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(D\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M=(D,I,J)\">\\(\\mathfrak M=(D,I,J)\\)</span>，其中 I 的定义域为 F，J 的定义域为 R；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\">\\(I(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J(r)\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\">\\(J(r)\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}\\)</span>。原记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{\\mathfrak M}=I(f)\">\\(f^{\\mathfrak M}=I(f)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r^{\\mathfrak M}=J(r)\">\\(r^{\\mathfrak M}=J(r)\\)</span> 保持不变；零元函数也按定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D^0=\\{()\\}\">\\(D^0=\\{()\\}\\)</span> 的函数解释。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\">\\(\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in D\">\\(d\\in D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\omega\">\\(k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(d_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in D^k\">\\((d_i)_{i&lt;k}\\in D^k\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 为项；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi,\\theta\">\\(\\phi,\\psi,\\theta\\)</span> 为公式。项求值及满足关系均按上游有限语法树的结构递归定义，不使用“通常解释”作为未传入的模型参数。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0c35680c0004f5e2\" href=\"?note=0c35680c0004f5e2\" title=\"20-df-formula\">20-df-formula</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf^{\\mathfrak M}:=I(f)\\quad(f\\in F),\\qquad\nr^{\\mathfrak M}:=J(r)\\quad(r\\in R),\\\\\n\\beta[v\\mapsto d]:=\\{(w,\\beta(w)):w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus\\{v\\}\\}\\cup\\{(v,d)\\},\\\\\n⟦ v⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}:=\\beta(v),\\\\\n⟦(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}:=\nI(f)((⟦ t_i⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M})_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(=,t,u)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n⟦ t⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}=⟦ u⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(⟦ t_i⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M})_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\in J(r),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\neg,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n((\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi[\\beta])),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\forall,v,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall d\\in D\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta[v\\mapsto d]]],\\\\\n\\beta[v\\mapsto d](w)=\\begin{cases}d&amp;w=v,\\\\\\beta(w)&amp;w\\ne v,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[\\beta]]\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[(d_i)_{i&lt;k}]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\\n[(\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\beta(v_i)=d_i)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[\\beta]]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf^{\\mathfrak M}:=I(f)\\quad(f\\in F),\\qquad\nr^{\\mathfrak M}:=J(r)\\quad(r\\in R),\\\\\n\\beta[v\\mapsto d]:=\\{(w,\\beta(w)):w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus\\{v\\}\\}\\cup\\{(v,d)\\},\\\\\n⟦ v⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}:=\\beta(v),\\\\\n⟦(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}:=\nI(f)((⟦ t_i⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M})_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(=,t,u)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n⟦ t⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}=⟦ u⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(⟦ t_i⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M})_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\in J(r),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\neg,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n((\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi[\\beta])),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\forall,v,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall d\\in D\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta[v\\mapsto d]]],\\\\\n\\beta[v\\mapsto d](w)=\\begin{cases}d&amp;w=v,\\\\\\beta(w)&amp;w\\ne v,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[\\beta]]\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[(d_i)_{i&lt;k}]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\\n[(\\forall i&lt;k\\ \\beta(v_i)=d_i)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[\\beta]]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;k\\}).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>I、J 是完整的解释表，所需符号不能留待读者猜测。原 f<sup>M、r</sup>M、赋值更新、句子满足和有限元组满足接口均保留。零元函数的解释是空元组到载体元素的函数，避免把一个数误作函数表使用。右侧逻辑联结词和量词属于元语言。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 的逻辑背景；本地 Tarski 递归展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)","display":false},{"tex":"D\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M=(D,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"I(f):D^{a_F(f)}\\to D","display":false},{"tex":"J(r)\\subseteq D^{a_R(r)}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{\\mathfrak M}=I(f)","display":false},{"tex":"r^{\\mathfrak M}=J(r)","display":false},{"tex":"D^0=\\{()\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}","display":false},{"tex":"v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(d_i)_{i<k}\\in D^k","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi,\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf^{\\mathfrak M}:=I(f)\\quad(f\\in F),\\qquad\nr^{\\mathfrak M}:=J(r)\\quad(r\\in R),\\\\\n\\beta[v\\mapsto d]:=\\{(w,\\beta(w)):w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\setminus\\{v\\}\\}\\cup\\{(v,d)\\},\\\\\n⟦ v⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}:=\\beta(v),\\\\\n⟦(f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}:=\nI(f)((⟦ t_i⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M})_{i<a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(=,t,u)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n⟦ t⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M}=⟦ u⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M},\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n(⟦ t_i⟧_\\beta^{\\mathfrak M})_{i<a_R(r)}\\in J(r),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\neg,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\neg(\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta]),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n((\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta])\\Rightarrow(\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi[\\beta])),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models(\\forall,v,\\phi)[\\beta]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall d\\in D\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\phi[\\beta[v\\mapsto d]]],\\\\\n\\beta[v\\mapsto d](w)=\\begin{cases}d&w=v,\\\\\\beta(w)&w\\ne v,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\ [\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[\\beta]]\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[(d_i)_{i<k}]\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\beta\\in D^{\\mathrm{Var}}\\\n[(\\forall i<k\\ \\beta(v_i)=d_i)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta[\\beta]]\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}(\\theta)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i<k\\}).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":3157,"backlinks":[{"id":"67ae4f0c8e4d1ac7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]；see [[20-df-pa]]。"},{"id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-provable]]；see [[20-df-classical-proof-system]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"a6a902146de6a471","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-low-high]]；see [[20-df-formula]]；see [[20-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"d85c7ced66d7ccee","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]] — 章 10；直接提供者 1 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-satisfaction]]"}],"outgoing":["0c35680c0004f5e2"]}